       }
      ]
     ],
     "nota": "",
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Meals and parts of the day",
     "texto": [
      "Meals have their own verb: **fare colazione** (to have breakfast), **pranzare** (to have lunch), **cenare** (to have dinner).",
      "Parts of the day: **la mattina** (in the morning), **il pomeriggio** (in the afternoon), **la sera** (in the evening), **la notte** (at night). No preposition.",
      "**Ogni giorno** = every day. **Presto** = early, soon. **Tardi** = late."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two irregular verbs you already need",
     "texto": [
      "**Vado** = I go (from «andare»). **Faccio** = I do (from «fare»).",
      "With times, **alle** is used: **alle nove** (at nine)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
